{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object. Check properties and perform task before moving to start position.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToStartPosition    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    />\"",
